                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Four Branches",
                                        "The junction\nlabels name\ndistricts rather\nthan premium\ntiers. The",
                                        "oldest label is\nhand cut and\nslightly crooked.\nBehind it, a\nworker",
                                        "wrote: Same winter\non both sides of\nthis wall. Slush\nhas not ordered",
                                        "the note removed,\nthough he can\ncertainly see it."
                                      ],
