                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The clerk posts\nthe packet beside\nthe wheel. Private\nrooms remain\nprivate; public",
                                  "service stays\npublic. Slush asks\nfor clear fault\nreports in return.\nPip accepts the",
                                  "duty and names\nMoxie as the\nperson who will\ncarry reports if a\nwire fails."
                                ],
